    <string name="tr_371" formatted="false">"Zlat\'s public 2018 routine, based on the Russian translation of his video.\n\nFinal set: 8+ reps → +5 kg; 7 → +2.5 kg; 6 → +1.25 kg; 5 → +0.5 kg; fewer than 5 → no increase. Each exercise is calculated separately, using the weight of its final planned set.\n\nStart with a weight you can lift for 10–12 clean reps and train in the 5–8 range. Do warm-up sets separately.\n\nThe 12 workouts are a journal layout, not an author-imposed cycle length. Copy the cycle when you finish. Past results are not recalculated."</string>
